Z||000000||Adrift||08-29-2001||01:24 PM||||I'd like to buy 17 inch rims for a fiero based kit car. I will be going to a HUGE store which only sells rims in the next few days to purchase them. I have a picture of the rim I'm interested in, but need to know what else I have to ask for (All I really know is the bolt pattern)<BR>Thanks'||||reg||1
